    "Group column = 'ntitle' (normalised paper title), identical to aggregate_3y.py rung_row(). NOTE: 5,999 unique groups over 6,030 rows, so grouped CV here is ~plain 5-fold; grouping bites much harder on other cells (N&C docket).",
